,{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["相信我的判断。一切尽在掌握之中。"],"enUS":["Trust my judgment. Every move here has been calculated."],"jaJP":["私の判断を信じて、状況はすべて想定内よ"]},"keys":["cv_mermaid_spy_CoopBelieve"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/650/6500030@8202500013964936143"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/650/6500030"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/650/6500030@-2357691418056310419"]},"audioName":"6500030"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["任何任务我都会全力以赴。哪怕只是抢小孩的糖果。"],"enUS":["I give my all to every mission. Even if it means stealing candy from kids."],"jaJP":["私は作戦において最善を尽くす、それが子供のキャンディを奪うことであってもね"]},"keys":["Voice_mermaid_spy_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_mermaid_spy_TouchReactionGood1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/650/6500031@3420893818504908140"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/650/6500031"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/650/6500031@3325083928639064243"]},"audioName":"6500031"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["我们在至暗处工作，是为守护至明之地。你我都该如此。"],"enUS":["Work in the shadows to protect the light.\nThat’s what all of us must do."],"jaJP":["私たち国家機関が血反吐を吐きながらも守らないといけない世界があるの"]},"keys":["Voice_mermaid_spy_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_mermaid_spy_TouchReactionGood2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/650/6500032@-1937278363518068738"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/650/6500032"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/650/6500032@8264361128279597546"]},"audioName":"6500032"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["队长必须根据队员优势分配任务。做不到便是无能之辈。"],"enUS":["A true leader assigns responsibilities according to individual strengths. Otherwise, they’re just incompetent."],"jaJP":["私たちは平時においてこそ活躍する存在、いったん戦争が始まってしまったら、その存在意義さえ失われるわ…"]},"keys":["Voice_mermaid_spy_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_mermaid_spy_TouchReacti